  "content": "<h1>ContingameIME</h1><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">IngameIME</a>的非官方延续版。在全屏Minecraft中使用输入法。</p><h1>切换键</h1><ul>\n<li>单击快捷键可在<strong>临时输入状态</strong>和<strong>关闭状态</strong>之间切换</li>\n<li>双击快捷键可切换到<strong>开启模式</strong></li>\n<li><strong>临时输入状态</strong>在鼠标移动且有内容提交时会切换为<strong>关闭状态</strong></li>\n</ul><h2>依赖项</h2><ul>\n<li><p>Forge</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin for Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>Fabric</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/satin-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satin API</a> <strong>（可选，与Optifine冲突）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h3>本模组需要VCRuntime141才能运行，请前往微软官方网站下载 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flearn.microsoft.com%252fen-US%252fcpp%252fwindows%252flatest-supported-vc-redist\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载链接</a></h3><h1>本模组代码参考/使用了以下内容</h1><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Wybxc/IngameIME-Minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wybxc/IngameIME-Minecraft</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n</ul>",
